  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "• 「ブルーディスティニー2号機」がHG最新フォーマットで登場！",
      "en": "• \"Blue Destiny Unit 2\" is now available in the latest HG format!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ガンダムタイプの頭部のほか、宇宙用バックパック、ビーム・ライフル、シールドが新規造形となっており、宇宙用バックパックは設定通りにブルーディスティニー1号機と同型のバックパックに重ねて装着する仕様！",
      "en": "• In addition to the Gundam type head, the space backpack, beam rifle, and Seal have been newly sculpted, and the space backpack can be attached to the same type of backpack as Blue Destiny Unit 1, as set!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肩アーマーは赤と青の2種類が付属し、赤い肩でニムバス機、青い肩で“奪われる前”の連邦軍機を選択式で再現できる！",
      "en": "• Two types of shoulder armor are included: red and blue, and you can choose to recreate the Nimbus aircraft with red shoulders or the Federation military aircraft “before it was stolen” with blue shoulders!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ツインカメラは選択式で、通常状態とEXAMシステム発動状態を再現可能！",
      "en": "• Twin cameras are selectable and can reproduce the normal state and the EXAM system activation state!"
    }
  ],
